  "body": "which may prevent crypto from working on clients that register with this way.\r\n\r\nThe issue is at:\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/74854a97191191b08101821753c2672efc2a65fd/synapse/static/client/register/js/register.js#L67-L69\r\n\r\nThe login fallback does not have this issue because it returns the raw CS API response:\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/74854a97191191b08101821753c2672efc2a65fd/synapse/static/client/login/js/login.js#L16",
